Usage: deployment/security-server/artifactory-publish-installer.sh <folder-name>

Uploads the X-Road installer archive, get-xroad.sh, upgrade-xroad.sh and
migration-cli.jar to https://artifactory.niis.org/xroad-scripts/<folder-name>/.

Required env vars:
  ARTIFACTORY_USER       Artifactory username
  ARTIFACTORY_PASSWORD   Artifactory password or API token

Optional env vars:
  ARTIFACTORY_BASE_URL   default: https://artifactory.niis.org
  ARTIFACTORY_REPO       default: xroad-scripts
